Regenerate: python3 scripts/generate-arm-ids.py
Verify: python3 scripts/generate-arm-ids.py --check

The generator takes util-linux's ID tables and adds Fastfetch's extra entries
and display spellings. It generates armids_data.go, licensed under
GPL-2.0-or-later AND MIT. The input C/C++ files are source material for the
registry generator; they are not compiled into separate native libraries.
Source hashes are pinned in the generator. No downloads occur during builds.
